rd runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, August to September came in at 39% of normal and June to July at 143%. Every grid had its driest year in 1953, as low as 58% on grids 21752 and 22050.</p>"}
